#: templates/planning/_left_to_spend.html:7
msgid ""
"The lower of the plan remainder and the cash remainder. Plan remainder: "
"spending target minus the spending paid so far and the spending still due "
"this month. Cash remainder: the lowest projected available money until the "
"month end, minus the planned goal contributions that are not reserved yet. "
"Without a spending target, it is the cash remainder."
